{"task": "classify_priority", "email": {"id": "em-16483", "thread_id": "th-13497", "reply_to": null, "from": "bartholomew.nkemelu@enron.com", "to": ["marisol.quintanar@enron.com"], "date": "2001-07-25T15:50:00Z", "subject": "Dunleavy Paper threatening to terminate - please call their CFO today", "body": "Marisol,

Dunleavy Paper was billed twice for June and their CFO is furious. He told me this morning that he will send a termination notice tomorrow unless he hears from someone senior today. Can you call him before 4:00 PM? His direct line is 713-555-0177. I will send you the account history in a minute.

Bart"}}

